# Code owners of the Paddock monorepo (ADR 0014 §9). Gitea reads this file and requests the owners as reviewers of a pull
# request. Patterns are Go regular expressions over the path from the repo root, not GitHub's globs: `apps/debrief/.*`, and
# a literal dot is `\.`. scripts/affected.test.mjs checks that every tracked file has an owner and that no pattern is a glob.
#
# With one human owner this is not a gate; it is the written form of "each task owns an explicit set of files": an agent's
# brief names its owned paths from here, and the shared integration points (crates/*/src/lib.rs, the root package.json,
# .gitea/, renovate.json) are changed by the integrating agent only. An imported app adds its own line.

# Apps, one line each.
apps/debrief/.* @decryp7
apps/dyno/.* @decryp7
apps/pacenotes/.* @decryp7
apps/pitcrew/.* @decryp7
apps/pitwall/.* @decryp7
apps/sighter/.* @decryp7
apps/spotter/.* @decryp7
apps/shell-demo/.* @decryp7
apps/workbench-demo/.* @decryp7

# Shared code.
crates/.* @decryp7
ui/.* @decryp7
eslint/.* @decryp7
conformance/.* @decryp7
tsconfig/.* @decryp7
lint/.* @decryp7
icons/.* @decryp7
templates/.* @decryp7
dev @decryp7
dev\.cmd @decryp7
\.claude/.* @decryp7

# CI, tools and the image.
\.gitea/.* @decryp7
ci-image/.* @decryp7
scripts/.* @decryp7
tools/.* @decryp7
spikes/.* @decryp7
renovate/.* @decryp7

# Family docs and diagrams.
docs/.* @decryp7
diagrams/.* @decryp7

# Root configs (the coordinator's).
(\.cargo/.*|\.editorconfig|lefthook\.yml|\.gitattributes|\.gitignore|\.nvmrc|package\.json|package-lock\.json|renovate\.json|CODEOWNERS|AGENTS\.md|README\.md|CHANGELOG\.md|LICENSE-[A-Z]+|paddock\.conformance\.json|paddock\.waivers\.toml) @decryp7
